title ALES233 — Lotus album_diff_sheet: what changed in a record, as a readable page
prompt Keep climbing the Lotus ALES ladder Lindy-first crux-first; send each finished increment as its own signed round; stop at custody gates.
think ALES231 (resolve) and ALES232 (diff) brought the album level to near-parity with the library. The last parity rung is the readable page for the diff: album_diff_sheet, mirroring library_diff_sheet (ALES230) one level down.
think The idiom is the projection: a Diff a program reads becomes a page a keeper reads — no new frame, no new hash, SheetError = Overflow only, since classify already proved every field. max_sheet_bytes bounds the page at header + summary + three records' worth of moved lines.
think Mirrored library_diff_sheet.rye exactly over album_diff.Diff and album_manifest bounds — the summary line, then added/removed/changed lines in order, a changed line carrying both digests.
obs GREEN on the first metal pass. The witness builds a before/after where one track is remastered (changed), one dropped (removed), one added, one unchanged (quiet), and proves all four laws including that the unchanged track never appears in a track line.
obs With this rung the album and library levels stand at full parity: each carries content address · readable page · resolve · diff · diff page. The catalog primitive family is complete at both scales.
loom witness=ales_album_diff_sheet_witness result=GREEN laws=4 rung=ALES233
file active-designing/20260815-144829_fill-ales233-lotus-album-diff-sheet.md the self-approved design read naming the crux and the four laws
file lotus/album_diff_sheet.rye the module — render_sheet over an ALES232 Diff, bounded page, Overflow-refusing
file tools/ales_album_diff_sheet_witness.rish builds and runs the selftest on metal, asserts the GREEN line
recommend keep-going the catalog family is whole at both scales; the next non-gated Lotus crux is a cross-level walk (a library that opens each album to verify) or a resolve-then-verify; the signed carry that names who made a record stays the crypto seam gated on Keaton's word.
